    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "线段和角都是基本的几何图形，也是构成其他几何图形的元素．我们已经学习了作一条线段等于已知线段的尺规作图，如何用直尺和圆规作一个角等于已知角呢?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        147,
        137,
        891,
        215
      ],
      "reading_order": 4,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        319,
        420,
        1937,
        660
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        166,
        219,
        1008,
        344
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        76.67,
        100.96,
        464.7,
        158.44
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "如图14.2-15（1)，已知 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A O B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，要用直尺和圆规作一个角与其相等，关键是能用直尺和圆规确定 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A O B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的大小."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        122,
        230,
        916,
        281
      ],
      "reading_order": 5,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        265,
        706,
        1991,
        862
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        138,
        368,
        1036,
        449
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        63.63,
        169.5,
        477.74,
        207.08
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "对于一个三角形，其三条边、三个角是确定的．如果能将 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A O B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "“放在”某个三角形中，作为其一个角，而我们又能用直尺和圆规作出这个三角形，进而再作出与这个三角形全等的三角形，根据全等三角形的性质， "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A O B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的对应角就是要求作的角．这就说明可以用直尺和圆规确定 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A O B"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        122,
        286,
        918,
        394
      ],
      "reading_order": 6,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        265,
        878,
        1995,
        1209
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        138,
        457,
        1039,
        630
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        63.63,
        210.77,
        478.78,
        290.36
      ]
    },
